---
// CareerSection - Tabbed career experience section
---

<section id="career" class="career-section">
  <div class="career-card card-parchment">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="exhibit-label">Court Record • Exhibit B</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Career & Experience</h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab navigation -->
    <div class="tab-nav">
      <button 
        class="tab-btn" 
        :class="{ 'active': activeCareerTab === 1 }"
        @click="setCareerTab(1)"
      >
        #1 Software QA
      </button>
      <button 
        class="tab-btn" 
        :class="{ 'active': activeCareerTab === 2 }"
        @click="setCareerTab(2)"
      >
        #2 Full-Stack & Mobile
      </button>
      <button 
        class="tab-btn" 
        :class="{ 'active': activeCareerTab === 3 }"
        @click="setCareerTab(3)"
      >
        #3 Pentesting & Bug Bounty
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab content panels -->
    <div class="tab-content">
      <!-- Tab 1: QA Engineer -->
      <div class="tab-panel" x-show="activeCareerTab === 1">
        <div class="witness-header">
          <div class="witness-title">
            <h3>Witness: Andriy Novan Rahman | Software QA Engineer</h3>
            <span class="period">2021 - PRESENT</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="witness-quote">
          "Your Honor, I swear to tell the whole truth regarding software flaws! I establish automated end-to-end and integration suites, design regression test cases, and catch high-severity production showstoppers before users ever encounter them."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="skills-badges">
          <span class="badge-court">Jest / Cypress</span>
          <span class="badge-court">Appium Mobile QA</span>
          <span class="badge-court">CI/CD Automation</span>
          <span class="badge-court">Postman API Testing</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab 2: Full-Stack Dev -->
      <div class="tab-panel" x-show="activeCareerTab === 2">
        <div class="witness-header">
          <div class="witness-title">
            <h3>Witness: Andriy Novan Rahman | Laravel & React Native Dev</h3>
            <span class="period">2019 - PRESENT</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="witness-quote">
          "Cross-platform execution is non-negotiable in this court. Building responsive frontend interfaces with React Native and robust backend API architectures with Laravel requires discipline, clean Eloquent schemas, and zero unhandled exceptions."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="skills-badges">
          <span class="badge-court">Laravel / PHP</span>
          <span class="badge-court">React Native</span>
          <span class="badge-court">RESTful APIs</span>
          <span class="badge-court">MySQL / Redis</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab 3: Pentester -->
      <div class="tab-panel" x-show="activeCareerTab === 3">
        <div class="witness-header">
          <div class="witness-title">
            <h3>Witness: Andriy Novan Rahman | Pentester & Bug Hunter</h3>
            <span class="period">SPECIALIZED INTEREST</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="witness-quote">
          "I actively audit web attack surfaces: OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities, IDOR flaws, broken object-level authorization, and SQLi. In bug bounty programs, finding that critical security oversight before malicious actors do is my primary verdict."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="skills-badges">
          <span class="badge-court">Burp Suite Pro</span>
          <span class="badge-court">OWASP Web & Mobile</span>
          <span class="badge-court">IDOR & BAC Audits</span>
          <span class="badge-court">Responsible Disclosure</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .career-section {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .career-card {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Section header */
  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
  }

  .exhibit-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
  }

  /* Tab navigation */
  .tab-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .tab-btn {
    padding: 10px 16px;
    background: var(--color-parchment-dark);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-wood-dark);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .tab-btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-wood-light);
    color: var(--color-parchment);
  }

  .tab-btn.active {
    background: var(--color-burgundy);
    color: var(--color-gold-light);
    border-color: var(--color-gold);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(128, 0, 32, 0.4);
  }

  /* Tab content */
  .tab-content {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 300px;
  }

  .tab-panel {
    animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-in-out;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  /* Witness header */
  .witness-header {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .witness-title h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }

  .period {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-burgundy);
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    background: var(--color-parchment-dark);
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
  }

  /* Witness quote */
  .witness-quote {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(245, 230, 211, 0.5);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .witness-quote::before {
    content: '"';
    font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .witness-quote::after {
    content: '"';
    font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-left: 4px;
  }

  /* Skills badges */
  .skills-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  /* Responsive adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .section-title {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .tab-btn {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      min-width: 120px;
    }

    .witness-title h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .witness-quote {
      font-size: 14px;
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .tab-content {
      min-height: 350px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .section-title {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .tab-btn {
      padding: 12px 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .witness-title h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
